NNOOTTEESS
     This ppss does not implement a -gg option, although the quick-
     help text above (taken from this system's /eettcc/hheellppffiillee
     entry) lists one; giving -gg is rejected as a bad option.
     Conversely, this ppss implements a -dd debug option that the
     quick-help text does not mention.  Both discrepancies are in
     the shipped /_e_t_c/_h_e_l_p_f_i_l_e text, not in this page.

     A process can change its own command name and arguments, so
     the command line ppss prints for it may not reflect what it is
     actually running.  The process table changes while ppss is
     running, so its output is only a snapshot.
